## What gets produced
- `tables/feature_table.csv` -- primary table (feature_table schema, `_shared/py/ospy/feature_table.py`)
- `objects/adata.h5ad` + `objects/handoff.json` -- AnnData handed on (ecosystem `scverse`)
- `figure_data/*.csv` + `figure_data/figure_request.json` -> `figures/*.pdf|png|figure_spec.json` (drawn by the R figure layer; style `_shared/docs/FIGURE_STYLE.md`)
- `draft/methods_results.md`, `qc/qc_results.csv`, `provenance/provenance.json`, `provenance/figure_render.json`
- `qc/engine_warnings.csv` -- every warning / logging message / error raised inside a stage (`stage, type, message`)

